Files:
  mt5_regression.py  derived from metricx24/models.py (MT5ForRegression).
                     Modified by LTT Studios on 2026-09-22: inference-only
                     forward pass (training loss, head-mask and model-parallel
                     branches removed); decoder start token is created on the
                     encoder output's device instead of a hard-coded "cuda".
                     Weight layout, output token 250089 and [0, 25] clamp unchanged.
  chay.py            input format "source: <src> candidate: <mt>" with EOS removed
                     and max length 1536 follows metricx24/predict.py (QE mode).
  ban_ghim.py, tai.py, phien_ban.json   written by LTT Studios.

Model weights are NOT stored here. They are downloaded at setup time into
